enus: produce entries back, open fix kept, nina in eng_words

All three produce entries return to the word list: the homog_roots
or-pair, the pnames U-vowel fix, and the roots yod form. open keeps
o p X n. nina enters eng_words with its own minted arm saying
n i y a. address/visual/quality/candidate stay out.
dict.py build laid it down and read its own work back word for word.
Applied at build time so CI builds the same tree.
